     1,
     "Hi,<div><br></div><div>since LDSC estimates heritability as the slope of a regression of the Z2 on the LD score, that slope can become negative. This cna happen with sumstats derived from certain tpes of mixed modesl (not likely the case here) or for low powered GWAS (so low N or low N_cases)/<br><br></div><div><br></div><div>Hope this helps!</div><div><br></div><div>Michel</div>"
    ],
    [
